// # Multimodal AI & Diffusion Acceleration Fail-Closed Stubs
//
// Logline: Enforces fail-closed security and execution barriers for native FlashDiffusion, TensorRT-LLM, Apple Metal, and cuDNN kernels.
//
// Setup: Fail-closed traps for native hardware acceleration backends lacking direct compiler codegen.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Trap CUDA and Triton FlashDiffusion UNet forward and backward accelerated kernels.
//   2. Trap TensorRT-LLM and ONNX Runtime ViT / CLIP FP8 matrix multiplication engines.
//   3. Trap Apple Metal MPS Conformer audio convolutions and cuDNN cross-attention pipelines.

/// Accelerated CUDA FlashDiffusion forward kernel launch.
/// COMPILER LIMITATION: openOODA compiler lacks native FlashDiffusion PTX codegen backend.
pub fn ai_multimodal_cuda_flash_diffusion_stub(cap: &SysCap) {
    // COMPILER LIMITATION: No native FlashDiffusion CUDA kernel available.
    process_exit(1);
}

